   ],
   "note": "describeEnv(env) + Rust dispatch::env::js_env: any JS ExecutionEnv (subclass, instance override, test double) as a native ExecutionEnv; every call goes to the object's own method with native cancellation mirrored into a JS AbortSignal. Re-hosts examples/support/tool_environment.rs."
  },
