  {
   "file": "crates/pi-durable/src/env/{filesystem,shell}.rs",
   "change": "additive FileErrorCode/ExecutionErrorCode::{ALL, as_str, from_name}; examples/env_stock_bridge.rs and dispatch/env.rs both use them (stock env gate re-run: all/spill/conformance pass both modes)"
  },
  {
   "file": "crates/pi-durable-jsrt/examples/embedded_stock.rs",
   "change": "node mode: the runner is the tests' process.execPath, so `process.execPath -e/--import/script` children run in pi-jsrt with the embedded modules and the same source routing (PI_DURABLE_EMBEDDED_REFERENCE)"
  },
  {
   "file": "crates/pi-jsrt/src/node.rs",
   "change": "run_with(args, configure, setup) for embedders; --import/--require preloads; --input-type=module for -e"
  },
  {
   "file": "crates/pi-jsrt/js/node/fs.js",
   "change": "createWriteStream honors highWaterMark (env-node-spill backpressure)"
  },
  {
   "file": "crates/pi-jsrt/src/ops/wasm.rs",
   "change": "detach grown WebAssembly.Memory buffers when the growing wasm call returns or calls into JS (V8 behavior; wasm-bindgen's cached views, Photon fixtures)"
  },
  {
   "file": "vendor/boa_engine/src/builtins/typed_array/{builtin,object}.rs",
   "change": "%TypedArray%.prototype.set fast path for dense number arrays; typed-array string keys that cannot be canonical numeric strings skip ToNumber/ToString. PATCH.md entries; regression tests in crates/pi-jsrt/tests/boa_patches.rs. Microbench (release, 4M calls): shared-array set 2843 -> ~1150 ms, literal-array set 4953 -> ~1900-2900 ms."
  },
  {
   "file": "crates/pi-durable-jsrt/examples/embedded_stock.rs",
   "change": "photon substitute alias (see substitutedDependencies)"
  }
